  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Partner Driven Cooperation Project between Biodiversity Conservation Agency, Research Center of Forest and Wetlands, Vietnam and Reforms, Entrepreneurship and Sustainability, Sweden on  developing a piloting model on payments for coastal wetland ecosystem services in Mui Ca Mau National Park in the context of climate change contributing to poverty reduction in local community</narrative>
